  Values and Saddle Points" (rm2-ex-1, rs19-8, rw21-9 and rw17-7), which
  lived inline in exercises.ptx, followed by the even-numbered problems of
  the old worksheet "Exercises for Lagrange Multipliers" (exer-xy-on-circle,
  rm2-lm-1, rw23-5, rw22-5 and pp-38), which lived in lagrange_exercise.ptx.
  The odd-numbered problems of both became Assignment 10
  (assignment-10-extreme-values-lagrange.ptx).

  rs-cardsort-critical ("Classify the Critical Points") closes the file.  It
